OL,3,GNEWSA'Inappropriate' campervan parking
OL,4,Acausing problems, councillor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are a rising number of campervans
OL,7,Fbeing parked in "inappropriate"
OL,8,Flocations across Gwynedd, a councillor
OL,9,Fsays.
OL,11,FCae Larsen has called for the local
OL,12,Fauthority Cyngor Gwynedd to take action
OL,13,Fto bring the situation "under better
OL,14,Fcontrol", amid a reported increase in
OL,15,Fthe number of motorhomes and campervans
OL,16,Fstaying in lay-bys, car parks, and
OL,17,Fscenic areas.
OL,19,FLarsen acknowledged the contribution
OL,20,Fmade by campers to the county's tourist
OL,21,Feconomy, however, adding that
OL,22,Fresponsible van owners were welcome.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
