OL,3,GNEWSA'Inappropriate' campervan parking
OL,4,Acausing problems, councillor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have also been raised on
OL,7,Fsocial media about campervans causing
OL,8,Froad and access issues, according to
OL,9,Fthe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,10,F(LDRS).
